 {
  "id": "cl-unless",
  "label": "Unless, Only If & Without",
  "branch": "CL",
  "parent": "br-cl",
  "kind": "cl",
  "icon": "cl",
  "chapter": "CHAPTER IV — UNLESS & ONLY IF",
  "week": 4,
  "lesson": true,
  "oneLiner": "“Unless” = “if not.” Negate the unless-clause and make it sufficient.",
  "definition": "“A unless B” translates to ¬B → A (equivalently ¬A → B). “Only if” and “without” introduce necessary conditions.",
  "objectives": [
   "Translate unless/until/without/only if",
   "Handle “no … unless” structures"
  ],
  "examples": [
   {
    "domain": "Everyday",
    "text": "You can’t enter unless you have a ticket: enter → ticket."
   },
   {
    "domain": "Law",
    "text": "The Senate never re-passes unless the bill is budgetary: re-pass → budget."
   },
   {
    "domain": "Business & Finance",
    "text": "Without consent, no contract: contract → consent."
   }
  ],
  "attack": [
   "Identify the unless-clause",
   "Negate it; make it the sufficient condition",
   "The rest becomes the necessary condition",
   "Check with an example"
  ],
  "correctLooksLike": "A clean arrow such as: Enter → Ticket.",
  "traps": [
   "Making the unless-clause sufficient without negating it",
   "Treating “unless” as biconditional"
  ],
  "commonError": "Reading “unless” as “if.”",
  "keyPoints": [
   {
    "point": "Unless = if not",
    "keywords": [
     "if not",
     "unless"
    ]
   },
   {
    "point": "Negate the unless clause → sufficient",
    "keywords": [
     "negate",
     "sufficient"
    ]
   },
   {
    "point": "Without X, no Y → Y → X",
    "keywords": [
     "without"
    ]
   }
  ],
  "mindMap": {
   "label": "Unless, Only If & Without",
   "children": [
    {
     "label": "Unless",
     "children": [
      {
       "label": "if not"
      },
      {
       "label": "Negate → sufficient"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Only if",
     "children": [
      {
       "label": "Necessary follows"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Without",
     "children": [
      {
       "label": "Y → X"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "label": "Until",
     "children": [
      {
       "label": "Like unless"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
